   "id": "2112579175513014427",
   "text": "Enter the Portal. Head to the Mine. Gear Up. 💎\n\nDescend into the depths of the mine, face the dangers that await, and fight your way to the boss. ⛏️\n\nDefeat the boss. Claim your rewards. Prove your worth. ⚔️\n\nThe mines are calling. Are you ready? https://t.co/sXIpdVUTea",
