  {
   "id": "2111833849856422334",
   "text": "4,444 Miners. 7 Pickaxes. 6 Swords. 6 Bosses. ⚔️\n\nEvery Miner has a story to tell. Gear up, explore the mines, fight powerful bosses, and discover what lies beneath.  \n\nYour Minehood adventure is about to begin. ⛏️💎 https://t.co/tWADd2R6bV",
