   "text": "The Minehood beta is actively being tested behind the scenes. 💎\n\nWe’re getting closer to bringing the game to you, and we can’t wait for you to experience what we’ve been building. ⛏️\n\nMore details coming soon. Stay tuned! 👀 https://t.co/wWkXzi3QIp",
